#: templates/privacy.html:12
msgid "privacy policy"
msgstr ""
"LMToolbox app (org.lukemech.lmtoolbox) does not collect, store, or "
"transmit any personal data. The application connects to network only to "
"update news feed from this website (if user won't turn the feature off). "
"No analytics, no user tracking, and no third-party data sharing is "
"performed."

